# Isla Soberana: the General's aide, Captain Ibarra, on the ramp at SOB or on
# a scratchy HF radio. (Fiction, inspired by the Ochoa affair; no real person.)
#
# Reads and acts through Talk.State: {{relations}}, {{status}}, {{passage_cost}},
# {{mule_pct}} / {{ship_pct}} (customs' odds right now), buy_passage(), mules(),
# container().

~ start
if not island
	Radio: Nothing but static on the island frequency.
	=> END
if status == "purge"
	=> purge
=> greet

~ landing
if status == "purge"
	=> purge
{{aide}}: [[Welcome to the Republic.|Bienvenido. Your papers are in order - they are always in order, for friends.|You're late. The General doesn't like late.]]
=> talk

~ greet
if relations >= 70
	{{aide}}: [[My friend! The General asks after you.|Ah, the General's favourite pilot.]]
elif relations < 35
	{{aide}}: (cold) The General remembers the defectors. What do you want?
else
	{{aide}}: [[Ibarra here. Speak.|Go ahead. This line is... mostly secure.]]
=> talk

~ talk
- Buy safe passage. ({{money_s(passage_cost)}}) [if passage_min == 0]
	do buy_passage()
	if result != ""
		{{aide}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{aide}}: The MiGs will be busy elsewhere. For a while.
	=> talk
- "What's the word on the island?"
	=> word
- Send four mules on the airliner. (each {{mule_pct}}% likely caught)
	do mules()
	if result != ""
		{{aide}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{aide}}: Four good girls, very calm. They leave on the evening flight.
	=> talk
- Put a container on the freighter. ({{ship_pct}}% likely found)
	do container()
	if result != ""
		{{aide}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{aide}}: Frozen shrimp. Very cold, very boring. Nobody likes to open it.
	=> talk
- That's all.
	{{aide}}: [[Viva la Revolucion.|Go carefully. The Americans are everywhere.|Until next time.]]
	=> END

~ word
if status == "hurricane"
	{{aide}}: A hurricane. The freighters stay in port and nothing is for sale until it passes.
elif status == "shortage"
	{{aide}}: Shortages. Fuel, rice, everything. Prices are up; the soldiers are hungry.
elif status == "glut"
	{{aide}}: The Colombians came in heavy. Prices are down - buy now.
elif status == "boatlift"
	{{aide}}: The General is letting people leave. Boats everywhere. Your Coast Guard doesn't know where to look.
else
	{{aide}}: Quiet. The price is {{money_s(int(price))}} a pound.
if relations < 40
	{{aide}}: (lower) And a word of advice. There are people in Havana - in the capital - who think some of us have too many friends. Be careful whose friend you are.
elif passage_min > 0
	{{aide}}: Your passage is good for {{passage_min}} more minutes.
=> talk

~ purge
{{aide}}: [[(a different voice) Captain Ibarra is no longer with the ministry.|(static, then a stranger) Ibarra has been arrested. So have his friends.]]
Radio: [[The island is closed. Anyone who lands will be treated as part of the plot.|Stay away from Soberana until this blows over.]]
=> END
